0..75 Comment "// Univalence at the corollas of a signature written by hand: `ua[1, 4]` is"
76..153 Comment "// reflexivity at the unit for the empty shape, then one `equiv` per corolla,"
154..223 Comment "// nested to the right (Shulman, _Univalence for Inverse Diagrams and"
224..302 Comment "// Homotopy Canonicity_, doi:10.1017/S0960129514000565), and its directed twin"
303..380 Comment "// is a flow of one `forward` per corolla (Gratzer, Weinberger and Buchholtz,"
381..441 Comment "// _Directed univalence in simplicial homotopy type theory_,"
442..463 Comment "// arXiv:2407.09146)."
465..512 Comment "// The magma, the swap and the unit\'s identity."
513..519 Keyword "import"
520..521 StringLit "\""
521..539 StringLit "./magma-base.gandr"
539..540 StringLit "\""
541..542 Other ";"
544..620 Comment "/// `ua[1, 4]` written by hand: reflexivity at the unit for the empty shape,"
621..699 Comment "/// then one `equiv` per corolla in catalogue order, the constant\'s before the"
700..778 Comment "/// binary one\'s, nested to the right. What the hand definition does not state"
779..856 Comment "/// is what `ua` checks beyond it: naturality along each corolla\'s symmetries"
857..934 Comment "/// (`pathological/higher-cells/ua-by-hand-unnatural.gandr`), and from degree"
935..1014 Comment "/// two (`ua-corolla-strata.gandr`) the Segal certification of the stages above"
1015..1032 Comment "/// the corollas."
1033..1036 Comment "///"
1037..1112 Comment "/// The directed twin is a flow: `stay` at the unit, then one `forward` per"
1113..1191 Comment "/// corolla, nested by `flowProduct` in the same order. A term ridden along it"
1192..1267 Comment "/// moves forward as it moves along the path: `rides` states it, as `moves`"
1268..1346 Comment "/// states the transport, and `ridden` runs it. The ride that would reverse it"
1347..1394 Comment "/// is refused, as every symmetry of a flow is."
